      "card_ids": ["C10"],
      "claim": "HM02 was more restricted to the periphery with a brain:plasma ratio of 0.3 in rat kinetic studies, arguing against robust CNS access for this similar analog.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "moderate",
